---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: approved investor invests with SAFT
    q_check_paused --> q_check_ended: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_ended --> q_verify_sig: hasEnded == false (sale active)
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale has ended
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_saft: signature valid from authorized signer (SAFT authorization)
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_check_saft --> q_check_amount: verify investAmount and tokenAllocationRate match SAFT terms
    q_check_saft --> q_revert_saft: SAFT compliance violation
    q_check_amount --> q_check_cached: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_amount: below minimum
    q_check_cached --> q_update: position.cachedInvestAmount = saftMaxAmount, position.cachedTokenAllocationRate = saftRate
    q_update --> q_transfer: position.investedCapital += amount, totalInvestedCapital += amount
    q_transfer --> q_update_refund: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_transfer --> q_revert_transfer: transfer failed
    q_update_refund --> [*]: position.lastInvestTimestamp = block.timestamp, emit Invested(investor, amount, allocationRate)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleEnded
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_revert_saft --> [*]: revert SAFTViolation
    q_revert_amount --> [*]: revert BelowMinimum
    q_revert_transfer --> [*]: revert TransferFailed

    note right of q_check_saft
        INV-001: Investment amount must not exceed SAFT-approved maximum
        INV-002: Token allocation rate verified against signed SAFT agreement
        INV-003: Signature replay protection via used-signature mapping
    end note

    note right of q_update_refund
        INV-004: Individual refund period starts from lastInvestTimestamp (14 days per MiCA)
        INV-005: Each investment resets the investor's refund window
    end note
